# RDS Desktop — OAuth (ECA) build config template. Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# The External Client App consumer key is a PUBLIC client id — this is a public
# PKCE client with NO secret (a secret is never created, stored, or committed).
# The key is baked into the build via electron-vite env inlining. Leave it empty
# to ship without the OAuth path; CLI sign-in needs nothing here.
#
# Create your own ECA per desktop/docs/OAUTH_APP_RUNBOOK.md and paste its Consumer Key.
# The MAIN_VITE_ prefix exposes it to the main process (where the PKCE flow runs).
MAIN_VITE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
